      "text": "[4:57PM] #TrafficUpdate #PWD \n\nThere is slow movement inward Airport Turning through National and Ikeja Along, but there is no cause for concern as personnel are on ground effectively managing the situation.\n\nPWD, Shogunle, Ladipo, and Bolade Junction are all experiencing smooth vehicular flow. However, the approach to Bolade Intersection is slightly busy due to traffic alternation.\n\nThe return journey is also moving well, with no major issues reported.\n\nAt the moment, there are no significant impediments along the route.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
