    {
      "type": "tweet",
      "id": "1951673565524476167",
      "url": "https://x.com/followlastma/status/1951673565524476167",
      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/followlastma/status/1951673565524476167",
      "text": "[4:44PM] #MobolajiBankAnthonyWay #TrafficUpdate \n\nVehicular movement is smooth along the Anthony service lane in both directions—toward and away from the Maryland intersection—leading to Odo Iyaloro and Mobolaji Bank Anthony Way, respectively.\n\nTraffic flow remains steady across key routes, including Oba Akran Road, Kodesoh Road, Local Airport Road, and Oba Akinjobi Way within Ikeja GRA, as well as inbound and outbound lanes of Mobolaji Bank Anthony Way.\n\nMovement along the Oba Akran Link Bridge and the Airport Link is also clear and free-flowing at this time.\n \nOur officers are stationed at designated choke points and are actively managing the flow as required.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
